iti62:4.1 starts: then,
# superseded: iti62:4.2 starts: from the ending
# superseded: iti62:4.3 starts: there’s the knowledge,
iti62:4.4 starts: ‘My release is unprovoked.’
iti74:7.1 starts: These children in the world,
iti74:7.2 starts: lay followers
iti74:7.3 starts: –consummate in virtue, conviction;
iti74:7.4 starts: generous, free from stinginess–
iti74:7.5 starts: shine forth in any gathering
iti74:7.6 starts: like the moon
iti75:6.1 starts: Not to contemplatives,
iti75:6.2 starts: to the miserable,
iti75:6.3 starts: does he share what he’s gained:
iti75:6.4 starts: food,
iti75:6.5 starts: He, that lowest of people,
iti75:6.6 starts: is called a cloud with no rain.
iti75:7.1 starts: To some he doesn’t give,
iti75:7.2 starts: to others he does:
iti75:7.3 starts: the intelligent call him
iti75:7.4 starts: one who rains locally.
iti75:8.1 starts: A person responsive to requests,
iti75:8.2 starts: sympathetic to all beings,
iti75:8.3 starts: delighting in distributing alms:
iti75:8.4 starts: “Give to them!
iti75:9.1 starts: As a cloud–resounding, thundering–rains,
iti75:9.2 none
iti75:9.3 starts: filling with water, drenching
iti75:9.4 starts: the plateaus & gullies:
iti75:10.1 starts: a person like this
iti75:10.2 starts: is like that.
iti75:10.3 starts: Having rightly amassed
iti75:10.4 starts: wealth attained through initiative,
iti75:10.5 starts: he satisfies rightly with food & drink
iti75:10.6 starts: those fallen into
iti78:6.1 starts: The underbrush born
iti78:6.2 starts: is cut away
iti78:6.3 starts: Just as one riding
iti78:6.4 starts: would sink
